    and D <= N.

rule section121_two_persons_section121a_requirements_met_1 with provenance "(a) Exclusion; (A) $500,000 Limitation for certain joint returns":
the rule section121 two persons section121a requirements met holds if
    the rule section121 two persons section 121 b 2 A condition holds.

rule section121_two_persons_section121a_requirements_met_2 with provenance "(a) Exclusion; (A) $500,000 Limitation for certain joint returns":
the rule section121 two persons section121a requirements met holds if
    it is not the case that the rule section121 two persons section 121 b 2 A condition holds
    and the rule section121 two persons section121Person1 requirements met holds.

rule section121_two_persons_section_121_b_2_A_condition_1 with provenance "(A) $500,000 Limitation for certain joint returns":
the rule section121 two persons section 121 b 2 A condition holds if
    the section121 two persons return type is a text
    and the text is equal to "JointReturn"
    and the rule section121 two persons section121Person1 requirements ownership met holds
    and the rule section121 two persons section121Person1 requirements usage met holds
    and the rule section121 two persons section121Person2 requirements usage met holds
    and it is not the case that the rule section121 two persons section121Person1 section 121 b 3 applies holds
    and it is not the case that the rule section121 two persons section121Person2 section 121 b 3 applies holds.

rule section121_two_persons_section_121_b_2_A_condition_2 with provenance "(A) $500,000 Limitation for certain joint returns":
the rule section121 two persons section 121 b 2 A condition holds if
    the section121 two persons return type is a text
    and the text is equal to "JointReturn"
    and the rule section121 two persons section121Person2 requirements ownership met holds
    and the rule section121 two persons section121Person1 requirements usage met holds
    and the rule section121 two persons section121Person2 requirements usage met holds
    and it is not the case that the rule section121 two persons section121Person1 section 121 b 3 applies holds
    and it is not the case that the rule section121 two persons section121Person2 section 121 b 3 applies holds.

